Search←{ ⍝ ⍺ ≡ depth alpha beta [table]; fail-soft negamax of board ⍵ → value, best square (¯1 if none chosen)
    d a z T←4↑⍺ ⋄ t←⊃9=⎕NC'T'
    q←{(⎕AI[2]≥T.dl)∨(T.mx>0)∧T.n≥T.mx:⎕SIGNAL 999 ⋄ T.n+←1 ⋄ 0}⍣t⊢0  ⍝ out of time or nodes: abandon (nothing stored)
    Ev←{⍺←⊢ ⋄ ~t:⍺ Eval ⍵ ⋄ T.base:⍺ Eval2 ⍵ ⋄ ⍺ Eval ⍵}  ⍝ the baseline evaluator if the table asks for it
    s←⍸Moves ⍵
    0=≢s:{∨/Moves⊖⍵:(-⊃(d,(-z),(-a),T)Search⊖⍵),¯1 ⋄ (100×Score ⍵),¯1}⍵
    d=0:(Ev ⍵),¯1
    k i e←{~t:0 0 0 ⋄ ~T.tt:0 0 0 ⋄ k←Key ⍵ ⋄ i←T.N|k ⋄ k i(T.K[i]=k)}⍵
    {~e:0 ⋄ T.D[i]≠d:0 ⋄ f x←T.F[i],T.V[i] ⋄ (f=0)∨((f=1)∧x≥z)∨(f=2)∧x≤a}0:T.V[i],T.Mv[i]
    h←{~e:¯1 ⋄ T.D[i]≥d:T.Mv[i] ⋄ ¯1}0
    c←s Play(≢s)2 64⍴⍵
    v←-Ev Leaf c ⋄ q←{T.n+←≢c ⋄ 0}⍣t⊢0  ⍝ nodes: Search calls plus boards scored
    o←{t:{T.ord:⍵ ⋄ ⍳≢s}⍵ ⋄ ⍵}⍒v ⋄ o←(o/⍨s[o]=h),o/⍨s[o]≠h  ⍝ table move first, then static value
    L←{i b m a←⍵ ⋄ i=≢o:b m ⋄ x←-⊃((d-1),(-z),(-a),T)Search c[o[i];;] ⋄ b m←(x>b)⊃(b m)(x,s[o[i]]) ⋄ a⌈←x ⋄ a≥z:b m ⋄ ∇(i+1)b m a}
    r←{d=1:(⌈/v),s[⊃⍒v] ⋄ L 0(-INF)¯1 a}0
    ~t:r ⋄ ~T.tt:r
    T.K[i]←k ⋄ T.V[i]←⊃r ⋄ T.D[i]←d ⋄ T.Mv[i]←1⊃r
    T.F[i]←(d>1)×((⊃r)≥z)+2×(⊃r)≤a
    r
}
